4	  "summary": "Phase 4: drill profiles + scoring refinement. Drill profiles are now first-class Dexie records (schema v3, `profiles` table) with full CRUD via Settings → Profile (Active / New / Rename / Delete; cannot delete the only remaining profile). Each profile owns a complete `DrillConfig` — `SettingsRecord` is now slim (just `commitKeyCode / commitKeyLabel / inputSource / activeProfileId`) and Phase 2/3 settings rows are migrated into a seeded `Default` profile via `readLegacySettingsOverrides` on first run. `loadActiveProfile` uses an in-flight promise singleton so React StrictMode double-mount cannot double-seed. The classifier now treats `lateThresholdMs` as a first-class threshold distinct from `responseWindowMs` (defaults: hesitation 450 / late 600 / response-window 1200); presses in [hesitationThresholdMs, lateThresholdMs) are hesitation, presses in [lateThresholdMs, responseWindowMs] are late. Scoring weights are configur
